{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1096027-rolls-for-making-battle-strategies","id":1096027,"title":"Rolls for Making Battle Strategies","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-23T14:26:27-07:00","id":1096027,"title":"Rolls for Making Battle Strategies","content":"Does it state in any of the books what you would roll to make some sort of battle plan or strategy, like a military general might do? If not, what would you suggest?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12947-enderdragon1201","name":"Enderdragon1201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12947_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T14:36:52-07:00","id":1096032,"title":"","content":"All sorts of rolls can be involved. Wits + Survival to see the opportunity in the terrain, Intelligence + Streetwise to lure someone into the back alley, Wits + Firearms to find good spots for your shooters, Resolve + Empathy to out smart your opponents. You know, think about <i>how </i>you want to do something and gather the pool that is closest to that way and the goal.<br /> Edit: Most likely general would have some merits involved, like Professional Training. Or something homebrewed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T15:22:57-07:00","id":1096051,"title":"","content":"Check out the Craft Equipment rules over Chronicles of Darkness, specifically the &quot;create plans&quot; one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T16:45:09-07:00","id":1096105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1096027-rolls-for-making-battle-strategies?p=1096051#post1096051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Check out the Craft Equipment rules over Chronicles of Darkness, specifically the &amp;quot;create plans&amp;quot; one.</div> </div> </div> </div>To elaborate, under this system, you craft a Plan (which functions as a kind of Equipment) with a Wits + Composure roll, or another dice pool at Storyteller discretion, penalized by the Plan's intended Equipment Bonus. On a success, the plan is created with no further complications. On a Failure, the plan has either the Fragile tag (you can only benefit from its Equipment Bonus a number of times equal to its Equipment Bonus), or the Volatile tag (any failures on rolls that benefit from the plan's Equipment Bonus count as dramatic failures, and also reduce the plan's Equipment Bonus by 2). On a dramatic failure, the attempt to create a plan fails, and some additional negative consequence occurs. On an exceptional success, the plan's Equipment Bonus increases by 1.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-24T01:06:43-07:00","id":1096200,"title":"","content":"If you need general 'mass combat' subsystem, I can point to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/857534-dark-eras-battle-mass-combat-rules\">my homebrew rules for mass battles</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}